NAME
       lvscan - list all logical volumes and whether they are active

SYNOPSIS
       lvscan

DESCRIPTION
       lvscan prints one line per logical volume in every volume group: ACTIVE
       or inactive, the device path in quotes and the size in brackets. lvs
       gives the same facts in a table that is easier to read and to filter.

EXAMPLES
           lvscan

SEE ALSO
       lvs(8), lvdisplay(8), pvscan(8), lvm(8)
